## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1 — Backend: New Disk Caches for News & Price Data

Currently only SEC filings (`filing_cache/`) and earnings transcripts (`transcript_cache/`) are cached to disk. News and price data are ephemeral (fetched on each request, stored only in RAM for the session). We need disk caches for all 5 data types so they survive restarts and can be reused by Deep Analysis.

