#### [NEW] [`backend/services/news_cache.py`](file:///c:/Users/mrsim/FinAnalSupTool/backend/services/news_cache.py)

Disk cache for company news results, keyed by `(ticker, start_date, end_date)`.

- `save_news(ticker, start_date, end_date, articles: list[dict])` — serialize to `backend/news_cache/{TICKER}_{start}_{end}.json`
- `get_news(ticker, start_date, end_date) -> list[dict] | None` — return cached articles or None
- `list_cached_ranges(ticker) -> list[tuple[str, str]]` — list all cached date ranges for a ticker
- Modeled on `transcript_cache.py`: best-effort writes, never raises

