#### [NEW] [`backend/services/price_cache.py`](file:///c:/Users/mrsim/FinAnalSupTool/backend/services/price_cache.py)

Disk cache for pre-computed technical/price data, keyed by `(ticker, start_date, end_date)`.

- `save_price_data(ticker, start_date, end_date, data: dict)` — serialize `TechnicalData` (as dict) + raw OHLCV candle rows to `backend/price_cache/{TICKER}_{start}_{end}.json`
- `get_price_data(ticker, start_date, end_date) -> dict | None`
- The cache key includes the date range so overlapping but different windows don't collide
- Stale data policy: price data older than 1 day is considered stale for the "current price" field, but historical candles remain valid. A `force_refresh` flag in the fetch endpoint will bypass cache.

